ad/t_thumb/sc14u1d.jpg"}], "slug": "velocrash", "summary": "Velocrash is a party racing game in which players take turns building the track before racing on it together. Each round, every player draws a random hand of cards and places one track piece or trap - such as saw blades, oil slicks, boost pads, or launch ramps - so the track grows longer and more chaotic every round. Finishing a race scores points, but sabotaging opponents is often more rewarding. The game features 3D arcade driving physics, online multiplayer for 2 to 8 players via Steam invite, two game modes (points race and time trial), two worlds, multiple cars and colors, and gamepad support. It is localized in five languages. VELOCRASH was created by a single developer and released into Steam Early Access on August 8, 2026, developed and published by Apolloxian Games.", "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/velocrash"}